 "why": "R-HARNESS S5 (#34071): the real-app check of ext_marker.py before journeys switch from text recognition to markers. Three batches of 8 markers in a new terminal (each marker is 4 rows: its token line, a blank line, the cells, a blank line; the tokens have descenders and underscores); every marker must decode to its own token from a fresh snapshot, and a token never printed must be absent from a frame that shows the batch's last marker.",
